{"kp_id": "zj-038.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-038", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "肾俞为近取要穴，腰痛可针可灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl23"], "chapter_id": "zj-038.c01", "evidence_quote": "进取穴多人就是肾疏，这一痛，用灸蛙统统可以", "seg_from": 32, "seg_to": 33, "start_s": 168.23, "end_s": 176.475, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nj6ywaKgfn4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nj6ywaKgfn4&t=168s", "series": "zj", "episode": 38, "title": "Ni Hai-Hsia \"Human Chronicles\": Acupuncture, Episode 38 (Full 90-Episode Series)", "start_s": 168.23, "end_s": 176.47}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "肾疏=肾俞；灸蛙=灸哇", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-038.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-038", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "腰痛正中为督脉，旁开约一寸半为膀胱经；须辨经选穴。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.gv", "meridian.bl"], "chapter_id": "zj-038.c01", "evidence_quote": "痛在中间，你知道啊这是督脉啊", "seg_from": 52, "seg_to": 53, "start_s": 293.75, "end_s": 310.63, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nj6ywaKgfn4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nj6ywaKgfn4&t=293s", "series": "zj", "episode": 38, "title": "Ni Hai-Hsia \"Human Chronicles\": Acupuncture, Episode 38 (Full 90-Episode Series)", "start_s": 293.75, "end_s": 310.63}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "东麦=督脉", "source": "llm_read"}
