{"kp_id": "zj-038.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-038", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "膀胱俞在第十九椎旁，近取治腰痛、小便不利及妇科病。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl28"], "chapter_id": "zj-038.c01", "evidence_quote": "第十九这一下呢就是膀胱膀胱雨", "seg_from": 94, "seg_to": 95, "start_s": 515.23, "end_s": 536.425, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nj6ywaKgfn4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nj6ywaKgfn4&t=515s", "series": "zj", "episode": 38, "title": "Ni Hai-Hsia \"Human Chronicles\": Acupuncture, Episode 38 (Full 90-Episode Series)", "start_s": 515.23, "end_s": 536.42}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "膀胱雨/影=膀胱俞", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-038.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-038", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "白环俞近尾椎；八髎穴小，在督脉与膀胱俞线之间。上髎等可灸助孕，主阴部及腰以下病。", "entity_ids": ["new.concept.八髎", "acupoint.bl31", "acupoint.bl30"], "chapter_id": "zj-038.c02", "evidence_quote": "八疗穴位是全身上下最最小的穴道", "seg_from": 122, "seg_to": 146, "start_s": 687.35, "end_s": 845.165, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nj6ywaKgfn4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nj6ywaKgfn4&t=687s", "series": "zj", "episode": 38, "title": "Ni Hai-Hsia \"Human Chronicles\": Acupuncture, Episode 38 (Full 90-Episode Series)", "start_s": 687.35, "end_s": 845.16}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "八疗/刺疗=八髎；上疗=上髎；白环鱼=白环俞", "source": "llm_read"}
